00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.720
MILLION COLOR!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>The Willgem was herded to and unable to move from the front of Queen Dianna's White Palace.</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.770
<i>Even after surviving my encounter with the Mahiroo Squad...</i>

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:34.650
<i>...I was told of the "Turn X" and found myself faced with more uncertainty.</i>

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:39.160
<i>It didn't appear to be because of Gym Ghingnham's Challenge.</i>

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:44.450
<i>Rather, It seems the White Doll had responded under its own will, and I don't know why.</i>

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.590
<b>The Shocking Dark History</b>

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:10.310
White Doll remembers that Mobile Suit?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.480
Turn X...

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.490
Leave the Turn A be.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.570
Why?

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.780
That Mobile Suit has motivations of its own.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.410
They're not like your Bandit.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.500
Pilot of the Turn A, are you listening?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.500
A fool like yourself who can't comprehend Dark History's true nature should hop out and flee!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.500
If you wish to keep your life, step down from the Turn A now!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:43.890
That means bow down on your knees before us, pilot. You'd better do it!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.890
Please stop this! I didn't come here with the personal intention to fight you.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.890
Quit your babbling, you overly-cute fool!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:03:00.110
What are these Mobile Suits? Did they dig them out from a lunar Mountain Cycle?

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.080
Why don't you stop this!?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:13.500
Don't you feel the desire to study and contrast the Turn A to the Turn X to one another side by side?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:21.090
I understand how you feel, pilot of Turn A. No need to worry, I'm gathering data as we speak.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.970
What is this power?

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.100
Gym Ghingnham...!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:36.270
Isn't the role of the Ghingnham Lineage to protect Moonrace and the line of the ruling Soriel family!?

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.190
Why are you betraying Queen Dianna?

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.280
Quit spouting such crap!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:47.280
Turn A is the taboo Mobile Suit which was known for destroying the ancient space civilizations.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:51.290
Wrecking the Turn A is simply another way of protecting Dianna!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.370
And here's a funny little story...

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:58.500
...once, long ago, the Turn X failed to defeat the Turn A in battle!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:06.180
Therefore, the scar on the Turn X's chest has been resonating, and the unit now aches to defeat the Turn A!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:09.470
Gym Ghingnham himself isn't the one who hates the Turn A so badly.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.810
Turn X's scar!?

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.190
The Turn A started to move, and the X also started moving in response to it...

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:27.280
Wouldn't it be rather funny to watch their systems willingly fight and destroy one another, Laura Rola!?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.080
This man... is losing his mind!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.200
Die together with them, Laura!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.300
Has Gym Ghingnham's prowess left you trembling in fear, Laura Rola?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.470
Why is this woman also calling me Laura Rola?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.180
General...

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.810
Did you receive the communication from the White Palace...

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.980
..The White Palace!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:01.980
What? Is this unit's resonation with the Turn A jamming any outside communications?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.280
What's up?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.280
It appears that the Terrans' forces have invaded the White Palace...

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.990
Should we counterattack?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.200
Don't worry about them.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:15.000
They're a force of less than one hundred Earth residents. We can find some way to deal with them later.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.080
Damn that Agrippa... What does he think he's doing!?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:22.880
They're not here...

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.090
Where's Sir Guin!? Where has Lady Lily gone off too!?

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.390
Is this a Mechanical Doll elevator?

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.470
It's a pretty enormous elevator...

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.190
But it looks like it hasn't been used very much.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.600
Find out about the Mechanical Doll's battle!

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.770
Capture all of this castle's workers and force them to talk!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.690
There should be some way to reach the other military installations!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:49.070
There's a passage heading east that'll lead us to a military spaceport!

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.990
A military spaceport?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.080
It can't be the one we used to enter here.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.290
- Alright!
- Coming through!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.290
So who wants to play guard duty?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.090
Miashei, Please be careful!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.510
Have you decided you don't love us anymore?

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.180
I'm just not used to using a Borjarnon!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.890
Alright, it should be straight ahead.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:19.400
Is that so? Does this road continue underground?

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.980
- What's that? 
- It's an announcement for the citizens of Genganam...

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.980
To all citizens of Genganam...

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:32.490
All laws which were announced under Dianna Soriel's name during the period when she was on Earth...

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.990
...are now considered null and void!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.210
Can that message be transmitted to every citizen in Genganam?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:42.880
That'd be impossible, even for Moonrace technology, whether we had an antenna or not.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.090
This was all originally planned by Agrippa.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.010
Say, Queen Dianna...

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:53.100
Isn't doing something like opening the Dark History supposed to bring disaster upon the entire world?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.680
The Dark History is nothing more than a record of the past.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:03.610
But doesn't Agrippa believe we'll all be killed by the Dark History's curse?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.490
Agrippa was likely being manipulated by Ghingnham.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.990
It appears the Queen is planning something!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:18.000
Bring the Gendarme to the Queen's private port in the Winter Palace.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.710
The Gendarme?

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.790
That's right.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.790
She's far too curious.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.090
Once she becomes aware of the Lunar Mountain Cycle...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:30.380
She'll seek to access data describing the Turn A and Turn X's legacy within the Dark History.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:33.590
When that happens, she will lose control.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.970
Using intimidation tactics and then trying to hide from me?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.190
Reducing my power output to a minimum...

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.900
Can they track me, or not?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:52.990
That radio transmission came from Queen Dianna. She's moving towards the Winter Palace.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:22.310
Sir Guin, this place feels like it's some sort of weird graveyard...

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:25.900
From the utter silence, and the odd looks of it, I'd have to agree with you.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.190
But at the same time...

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.770
It's quite elegant for a graveyard.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.780
It looks like the Winter Palace is still perfectly fine.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.780
Agrippa didn't forget about his duty here...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.570
What exactly is this place?

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:41.410
No way... this can't REALLY be a Moonrace graveyard, can it?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.370
It's the home of the data system, and the hibernation capsules.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.500
Uh, Queen Dianna?
- Yes?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.290
Thank you for everything.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.590
To what are you referring?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:54.590
Back when I saw you crying for me and my father at his grave.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.890
Ahh, you mean when we switched places and I was taken to the Heim's house?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.100
Right.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.810
You appeared to be even sadder than I was.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.400
Oh father, I'm so sorry!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.690
I'm sorry it took so long for me to come back...

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.690
It's just that I have been kept so very busy by my work.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.410
I really am terribly sorry, father.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.410
Back then, that was actually Miss Dianna!?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.000
That's right, Sochie.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.500
From that day forward, I was posing as the Queen of the Moon, Dianna.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.000
Dianna Counter then took me back to the Soleil as well.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.090
You actually did exchange places!?

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.590
Back then, it was just a small game we were playing.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.380
But in the end we were unable to swap back.

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.680
And because of that, I have come to fully understand Queen Dianna's heart.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.680
Why would you finally tell me something so important at a time like this!?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.980
The time was never right to tell you up until now... Sochie, you...

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.100
Then...

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.400
The constitutional speech that day in Sunbelt...

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:54.110
The announcement that a nation would not be created by force... Kihel was the one who delivered it?

00:09:54.110 --> 00:10:01.910
Correct. Kihel Heim had been trapped aboard the Soleil. Therefore, she wrote the entire speech completely by herself!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.910
How could that be? That speech was exactly what Dianna Soriel would have delivered...

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:13.710
l will now give up this idea of declaring a Moonrace Fiefdom in the Sunbelt...

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.680
...I would like for us all to inhabit this world of our ancestors...

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.010
...And so, I will cancel our declaration of a new fiefdom within the Sunbelt, and...

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:25.810
...I will instead request to once again begin negotiations between our Moonrace and...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.690
Back then, the one next to me... was actually Lady Dianna Soriel herself!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.980
Then that means...

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.990
This girl, Kihel, has been working very diligently!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.500
At that point... It was actually Lady Dianna Soriel as well!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:48.790
I'm so terribly sorry!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.500
There's no way... How could that possibly be!?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.000
How could the Moon's Queen, who wished to invade us, and my sister do this?

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:00.010
If I had've known that you went through a challenge even greater than fighting Mechanical Dolls...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.010
...I would've had less misdirected anger!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.980
After finally finding your brother, all you can do is hide...

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.650
I suppose you don't want Merrybell to discover where you are?

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.490
The pilot wants to keep the Canal from being damaged...

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.910
He must be from the Moonrace.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.000
He seems to be a tricky enemy, doesn't he, Gym Ghingnham?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.500
Which only makes him a more interesting enemy.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:36.290
We may have a problem if he forces me to bring out the Turn X's full potential...

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.350
That bastard has to have things his way...

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.270
Sutero, Sir! You can't go off to the Palace!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.030
What!?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:02.820
I shall not allow a man who would fight in front of Dianna's Palace to pass!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.620
The only thing you personal Guards are good for is chasing after the Queen's ass!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.830
You DARE speak of Queen Dianna's "ass" so casually...

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.040
...YOU BASTARD!?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.540
An ass is just an ass! Something wrong with it!?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:19.340
It's because of vulgar men like yourself that I cannot support the Ghingnham faction!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.840
Once this matter of Agrippa's betrayal is over...

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.140
The Moon and the Earth will be able to agree to a cease-fire...

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.310
And the people from Earth can return back home to it!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.740
Lieutenant Harry is fighting against the Mahiroo Team!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.240
Then for today, do we trust in the Lieutenant's abilities?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:53.040
It appears the Royal Guard forces still on the moon won't be our enemy.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.710
That's a good thing.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.830
Assemble into the Clash formation!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.710
With that much damage, such a tactic is impossible.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.340
Once I've damaged your sensors...

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:05.630
What more can you do?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.640
What?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.940
I WARNED YOU!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.030
The Ghingnham Lineage don't appear to have any idea how a real battle is fought...

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.530
...Sweatson Sutero!

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:29.030
You may understand the limitations of the Mahiroo...

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:33.040
...But for now, I'll thank you for showing me how a "real battle" is fought!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.710
I got it, that was an excellent moment.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.210
Alright, please let me down.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.340
That Lieutenant really is on our side in this one!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.510
It seems that way. Let's go back, then.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.520
What? It disappeared?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.120
Don't make any careless moves!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:13.540
He's using his full power to bend light by using electromagnetic waves.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.120
If he's a moon citizen, you can guarantee he won't go very far...

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.340
The spaceport is directly connected to the Winter Palace?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.840
Of course it is!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.340
My apologies.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:37.020
But our retreat will only legitimize Dianna's reinstatement back into power in the eyes of the people.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.310
We've failed.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.230
We were left with no other choice.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:46.320
We have no way of knowing what course of action that Dianna lover, Harry, may have followed.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.450
Where should we go?

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.620
- Have you established contact with the Gendarme?
 -Yes.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.030
Then we'll take a shortcut.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.330
Isn't this the history data-bank?

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.830
I have no interest in ancient history.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.540
You don't say?

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:07.920
But the Turn X and Turn A seem to be connected to the distant past...

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.720
They caused the end of ancient history.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.720
And that's the end of it.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.720
Everything that once was...

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.640
What's that!?

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.140
Follow the Luzianna Militia!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.730
Lady Lily Borjarno!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.520
John, where has Ames gone?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:30.240
He went with the Inglessa guys. He's inside already.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.910
Miashei, thank you for assisting and taking care of our Princess!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.740
As long as you don't mind loaning me a Borjarnon...

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.620
Sochie and I can handle little tasks like this with ease!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.750
Oww!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.120
Lead the way unless you wanna get hurt!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.830
Is Sir Guin still here with us?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.540
Yes! Excellent Work, Sergeant Yanni.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.550
Are we going into the grave yard?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.510
This isn't a grave yard.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.010
Keep your hands off of everything in that room!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.010
What is there to put our hands on?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.720
Did you put traps like holes or a collapsing ceiling in there?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.810
You mentioned the Dark History being stored in this room, right?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:02.810
But...there aren't even any books in there!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.230
Books!?

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:07.610
That's why l don't want anything to do with you primitive fools.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.320
You're just prejudice.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.030
Lady Dianna Soriel!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:15.910
You're a man who simply hides on the moon while spouting rubbish about prolonging our lives, Agrippa Maintainer.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.910
Gym Ghingnham is happy that you've granted him the power to enforce martial law...

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:24.540
...and Sir Guin is here for the sake of developing humanity's intelligence.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:31.210
And yet, the gathering of so many different people with conflicting intentions is bound to cause a disaster.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:36.930
You should stop and contemplate why our history was called the "Dark History".

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:47.020
If you activated the Dark History after such a huge gap in time, the Terrans probably wouldn't even be able to comprehend it at all!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.610
That's also prejudice.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.740
Once you know something, that doesn't mean you'll just live with that knowledge.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.530
Sometimes, once you know something, it's bound to have some consequences.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.040
What're those!?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:05.920
It's a view of a space colony that once held millions of people falling on the earth.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.630
A "space colony"... falling on the earth?

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.720
You mean it's not just a movie!?

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.510
This is the record from ancient history.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.720
That ship is flying into space!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:21.640
These are scenes from the "Universal Century", a period of space wars that occurred after the "Anno Domini".

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.930
It's the White Doll and a Borjarnon!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:26.940
They look a bit different. They appear to be older.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.940
There was once a long history of wars fought in space.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:33.940
I want you all to understand this fact, then just try to imagine the result of it all.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.610
These results...

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.320
Could these Terrans even imagine what it was like?

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:48.540
Brother, every time I think I've spotted you, I just bump into some 3D projection!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.840
Why these hollow decoys?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:55.630
No! l thought it was your Turn X that was making them!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:04.640
So where are these images on the monitor being broadcast from?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:07.020
The direction of the Winter Palace...?

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.320
What!? That Mobile Suit like thing is...

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.120
Merrybell, don't be scared of them!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.740
Turn A!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.620
What's wrong!? I can't control this!?

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.330
Turn X!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:34.840
Another showed up!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.130
Interrupted again?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.510
I see... something is playing back this data!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:51.150
What in the world are those tube like things?

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.810
Those were Space Colonies.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.320
Really?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:57.940
But, this isn't any kind of normal projection monitor!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:01.030
You're right. We don't have any kind of theater like this in Genganam.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.320
Does Lieutenant Harry know anything about it?

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.040
This is an image from the ancient "Universal Century".

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.120
What is this "Universal Century"?

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.330
Right now, I'm determining where it's being broadcast from.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.920
It's being broadcast from the Winter Palace...

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:17.920
...and I imagine the images are being carried through an unused radio frequency at the transmission source.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.220
These bizarre screens are showing up everywhere in the city...

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.430
It must be some big company doing a major visual promotion.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.430
I don't think these are just promotions.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.810
Shut your yap, retrieve the other units, and get them back to our base!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.230
Sir!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.110
Don't you think this is a bit too large-scale for a movie promo?

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.530
Could these truly be images of ancient history!?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:45.410
These events known as the Dark History eventually led to mankind's last war...

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.540
...one which lasted for several hundreds of years.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.620
Several hundreds of years!?

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.040
That is correct.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.710
If humanity really intended to start their final war...

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.710
...Armageddon, there's no reason that it'd finish in a few mere days!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.420
Commander Gavane...

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:01.130
Looks like no matter what time period it was, the Borjarnon were always around!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.130
I understand...

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:09.720
Dianna Soriel has revealed the Dark History to the Terrans in order to let the citizens see why we can return to the earth...

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.940
However, it's not that simple.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:17.020
Allowing them to know the truth of the Dark History will only reawaken their fighting instinct!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:22.030
Naturally, in order for us to return, a force of civilian recruited soldiers was already put to use!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.530
My time has come!

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:31.620
I see! So they're saying that the world will turn out just like the Dark History in the future!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.830
Isn't that a good thing?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.040
After the condition of earth and the moon declined...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.340
Life for those who were living on the colonies became unstable.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:47.850
Many of those space colonies then used the best technology available to migrate out into interstellar space.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.520
This is the period that we now refer to as the Dark History.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:55.310
It seems like humanity truly has always been repeating the same mistakes...

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.440
I haven't yet input the data that was recovered at the Mountain Cycle...

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:02.110
Or the "Turn code" that we received from the units.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.440
Perhaps then we'll...

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.410
Turn A!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.740
This data here has only shown us the surface truth of the situation...

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:17.130
But... it says the Mustached Mobile Suit was used to terminate earth's civilization...

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.630
...by using an attack named the "Moonlight Butterfly"!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:37.520
The Terrans never understood what this imagery truly meant!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:43.030
The Turn A spread its nanomachine across the earth, and then these nanomachines...

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.030
...reduced the earth's civilizations into sand and assimilated themselves into the earth's surface.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:53.830
After it had completed that mission, the Turn A was buried within the Mountain Cycle.

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.710
It buried remnants from the ancient civilization there as well...

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:58.330
By using this hurricane...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.540
Nanomachines...

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.420
So is that the unit's true power?

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.510
Turn A was that kind of machine...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:12.810
And his counterpart was the Turn X!

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:15.730
This is something the Winter Palace data doesn't reveal!

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b><i>Yama no ha tsuki wa michi</i></b>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b>As the full moon, casts itself over the mountain's edge...</b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b><i>iki zuku anata no mori</i></b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b>...it spreads the breath of life spreads into the forest where you stand...</b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b><i>Natsu kusa abite nemuru</i></b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>As you sleep in the summer grass...</b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b><i>Itooshii yokogao</i></b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b>...your profile is a lovely sight to behold.</b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b><i>Kaze ni</i></b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>The wind...</b>

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.780
<b><i>LaLaLu... LaLaLu...</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b><i>utae... hane ni</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b>The sight of your wings, is seen...</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b><i>tsuki utsushi</i></b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b>...in the moon's reflection.</b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b><i>Inochi kagaya kase yo</i></b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b>This wonderful life will shine vividly.</b>

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:45.570
<i>Without anywhere else to turn, Midgard attacks the Winter Palace and Queen Dianna.</i>

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.650
<i>The White Doll unlocks its undiscovered power and successfully protects them.</i>

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:55.740
<i>However, is this power going to reopen the lost pages of the Dark History?</i>

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:00.750
<i>Next Time ...on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.000
<i>A New Enemy</i>

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.630
"The wind makes up the light."

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:08.460
<b>A New Enemy</b>
